            "text": "Questions before you join",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "subheading_2": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Something else? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Write to us</a> or <a href=\"/pages/book-a-call\">book a call</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which paints do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>Six tubes of artist or student watercolour, a size 8 and a size 4 round brush and a pad of 300 gsm cotton paper. The list names good options at three prices, and a call can check what you have.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use the set I already have?",
            "answer": "<p>Usually yes. Paper matters most, so start there. Module one says which colours in a set are worth keeping and which to replace first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I paint on an iPad instead?",
            "answer": "<p>The shapes and composition lessons work in any painting app. Water and paint behave differently on a screen, so most of the course assumes real paper.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I miss a live review?",
            "answer": "<p>Every call is recorded and added to the course the same day. Send a photo of your painting beforehand and Clara reviews it on the recording.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do I keep the lessons?",
            "answer": "<p>For as long as the course exists. Lessons, recordings and the colour charts stay in your account, and updates are free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pay in parts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. At checkout choose three monthly payments instead of one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Email us within 30 days of joining and you get a full refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
